{"id":"33583786ba118856","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-diagonal-closure.md","title":"Diagonal Image Characterization","display":"thm-diagonal-closure — Diagonal Image Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-diagonal-closure","aliases":["90-thm-diagonal-closure"],"display":"thm-diagonal-closure — Diagonal Image Characterization","depends_on":["[[90-df-diagonal-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-diagonal-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-diagonal-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diagonal-closure — Diagonal Image Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30651fa49cc3e16\" href=\"?note=e30651fa49cc3e16\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-closure\">90-df-diagonal-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(D:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (diagonal function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}(S)=D[S]\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}(S)=D[S]\\)</span> (diagonal image, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30651fa49cc3e16\" href=\"?note=e30651fa49cc3e16\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-closure\">90-df-diagonal-closure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}closure}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(y\\in\\mathrm{Diag}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists x\\in S\\;y=D(x)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}closure}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(y\\in\\mathrm{Diag}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists x\\in S\\;y=D(x)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该式刻画集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 下的像，不是公式不动点定理；文件标签保留历史名称 <code>diagonal-closure</code>。</li>\n<li>一般的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D[S]\">\\(D[S]\\)</span> 未必包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，也未必满足幂等律；因此不能在无额外条件时把它当作闭包算子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-diagonal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"e30651fa49cc3e16","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"e30651fa49cc3e16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Diag}(S)=D[S]$ (diagonal image, see [[90-df-diagonal-closure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diag}(S)=D[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}closure}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(y\\in\\mathrm{Diag}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists x\\in S\\;y=D(x)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D[S]","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":934,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-thm-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal.md]]\n[[90-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm.md]]\n[[90-thm-kleene-second-recursion.md]]\n[[90-thm-min-closure-rec.md]]\n[[90-thm-myhill-operator.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursion-theorem.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursive-set-representation.md]]\n[[90-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-smullyan-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]"}],"outgoing":["e30651fa49cc3e16"]}